{"detail_id": "n18", "detail": "Attempting to dissolve or strike off an insolvent company to avoid paying creditors is a serious misuse of the Companies Act 2006 provisions. Creditors can object to the strike-off, and if it proceeds, the company can be restored to the register. Directors involved could face investigations, disqualification, or even personal liability if fraudulent activity is suspected.", "category": "Risks / Pitfalls", "provider": "Company Dissolution / Strike-Off", "card_name": "", "value": "", "source_urls": ["https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFFpUS28-OpvEwXD-PabBVB6_XWah2R76S6eNx8GQpVpALz1tBwnAN8eSBfFaUhIP_-DUkTB6tyQ3Chcq8g2UoDhS2XxrQAhCPGaEvC9SbrPaGAoIFOVl0wSEDgkpg91egNQFjF63cIsfiXWDXk6clrHpc04hIQh7aBTDglKv2YiJiNWQXGIGr18XfWKb4sE5uH0EP_x-tyM0PpARiuHP4="], "mentioned_by": ["gemini · risk"], "article_status": "missing", "recommended_display_format": "warning_callout", "recommended_action": "", "priority": "medium", "needs_primary_verification": true, "source_required": true, "last_checked_required": true, "editorial_note": "", "verification_status": "unverified", "verified_source_url": "", "verified_quote": "", "verify_date": "", "evidence_tier": "", "notes": "", "cannibalisation_risk": false, "cannibal_owner_url": ""}
{"detail_id": "n19", "detail": "A director (or shadow director) of a company that has gone into insolvent liquidation is prohibited by Section 216 of the Insolvency Act 1986 from being involved with another company (or business) that trades under the same or a similar name for five years. Breaching this is a criminal offence, punishable by imprisonment and/or a fine, and can lead to personal liability for the new company's debts.", "category": "Director Liability / Personal Risk", "provider": "General", "card_name": "Section 216 Insolvency Act 1986 (Phoenix Companies)", "value": "5 years", "source_urls": ["https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHH7Phc7Wr2BB89pvY8zYhEFeAwtoJmnXhNQBlF9ZYYY9GjLXRLFTyTZoNh11wpOcBqKuxna2D972zT5YPHp5o1z-wyZJdWBl-xTxlL_2CMRNAK4TA1lTCJjILSW0r4GvVxsT5ef0AmbpRYTJpAyA=="], "mentioned_by": ["gemini · risk"], "article_status": "missing", "recommended_display_format": "warning_callout", "recommended_action": "", "priority": "medium", "needs_primary_verification": true, "source_required": true, "last_checked_required": true, "editorial_note": "", "verification_status": "unverified", "verified_source_url": "", "verified_quote": "", "verify_date": "", "evidence_tier": "", "notes": "", "cannibalisation_risk": false, "cannibal_owner_url": ""}
